<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoVersionPatch"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoVersionPatch</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><varname>SilikoVersionPatch</varname></refname>
  <refpurpose>Integer holding patch version number</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Version.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">extern const unsigned int SilikoVersionPatch;</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <varname>SilikoVersionPatch</varname> value holds the
patch version number of the Siliko Core library. The patch version is
incremented when a bug fix is made that doesn’t change Siliko Core’s
API.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
